        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX FH27PD8010, Linear Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Linear Pocket Door Passage Set allows for free egress through your sliding pocket door. The Linear Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware comes packaged with two pulls--one for each side of the door--a mortise box, and all the mounting hardware. The Linear FH27 Flush Pull Set comes with a mortise box that has a built-in finger pull that can retract. When needed, the finger pull can be deployed by pressing of the button beneath it. Choose from a wide array of beautiful finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/linear-pocket-door-privacy-set-inox-fh27pd8440\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/linear-pocket-door-keyed-entry-inox-fh27pd8450\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Linear Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass or Stainless</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-23/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 5/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 5-29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Depth: 3-41/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Backset: 2-3/4\", 2-1/2\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-FH27PD8010-specifications.pdf?v=1704262378\"><b>INOX FH27PD8010 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) rectangle flush pulls, a passage set mortise pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
