                "description": "The Linear Pocket Door Passage Set allows for free egress through your sliding pocket door. The Linear Passage Mortise Pocket Door Hardware comes packaged with two pulls--one for each side of the door--a mortise box, and all the mounting hardware. The Linear FH27 Flush Pull Set comes with a mortise box that has a built-in finger pull that can retract. When needed, the finger pull can be deployed by pressing of the button beneath it. Choose from a wide array of beautiful finishes. \r\n",
